  "source_caveat": "BLS official downloadable industry series catalog defines the parent trucking NAICS 484 subsector PPI with padded series ID PCU484---484--- rather than the FRED-distribution alias PCU484484. Direct BLS API v2 POST returned 96 monthly 2017–2024 index observations for the correct native ID, matching the historical FRED public snapshot at numerical precision. The original FRED-series alias was not a valid BLS API identifier in v1/v2. BLS bulk text-download access returned HTTP 403 specifically in the GitHub runner; original metadata is public through web retrieval, but bulk file bytes were not authenticated in CI. The annual unweighted PPI-adjusted 2017–2024 Census employer-industry revenue change remains ONLY an illustrative producer-output-price-level proxy, NOT official real freight output, freight volume, invoice billing errors, paid freight spend, independently approved buyer demand, or a recoverable market. All 18 independent real-customer pilot controls remain unmet."
